{
  "bookId": "hero-214202",
  "id": "bond-26001",
  "sections": [
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "sourceId": "26001001",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "焯焯焯……！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "26001002",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "曹操",
          "text": "你是将来的君主，随随便便如此惊慌，成何体统。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "26001003",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "你没看到吗，刚才一只大蜘蛛跑了过去。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "26001004",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "曹操",
          "text": "泰山崩于前而色不变，麋鹿兴于左而目不瞬，此为将之道。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "26001005",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "曹操",
          "text": "若是其他人见你如此，你可知他们将作何想法？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "26001006",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "……他们也会觉得那蜘蛛很可怕？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "26001007",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "曹操",
          "text": "……荒谬。看来你要成为君主，你还有很长的路要走。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "26001008",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "我可从来没说过我要成为君主，还有曹操，比起说教……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "26001009",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "不如你先处理下这个危险？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "26001010",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "有这蜘蛛在，我感觉我今晚都睡不着觉了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "26001011",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "曹操",
          "text": "我在十岁可在龙潭搏击鳄鱼都不怕，你却怕一只小小蜘蛛？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "26001012",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "……如果我还是十岁，我觉得我应该也不怕？会去抓着玩？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "26001013",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "曹操",
          "text": "朽木不可雕也……你退远点！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        }
      ],
